abstract: >
  Replication package for the manuscript "Quarantining Environmentally Fragile
  LLM-Generated Tests: A Project-Level Empirical Study on SWE-bench Verified".
  Contains the static AST risk screener, dynamic shuffle profiler, four-tier
  triage implementation, socket-guard instrumentation for hermetic CI, experiment
  drivers, and the archived formal run with a 363-file SHA-256 manifest.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - unit test generation
  - flaky tests
  - continuous integration
  - test quarantine
  - SWE-bench Verified
  - empirical software engineering
